AUDIENCE: Wait.

01:13:49.690 --> 01:13:50.690
This doesn't make sense.

01:13:50.690 --> 01:13:51.010
So what's [INAUDIBLE]?

01:13:51.010 --> 01:13:51.330
AUDIENCE: Fine.

01:13:51.330 --> 01:13:52.275
AUDIENCE: Parabola,
and it's like a--

01:13:52.275 --> 01:13:52.860
AUDIENCE: That's a [INAUDIBLE].

01:13:52.860 --> 01:13:53.510
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

01:13:53.510 --> 01:13:54.540
AUDIENCE: It looks
