01:13:54.540 --> 01:13:55.580
AUDIENCE: I like it.

01:13:55.580 --> 01:13:56.330
AUDIENCE: [LAUGHS]

01:13:56.330 --> 01:13:58.660
AUDIENCE: Yeah.

01:13:58.660 --> 01:13:59.765
AUDIENCE: Steal your idea.

