01:14:01.390 --> 01:14:02.470
AUDIENCE: Well, then, make it.

01:14:02.470 --> 01:14:02.790
AUDIENCE: Wait, hold on.

01:14:02.790 --> 01:14:04.500
Let me explain what it
is, though, [INAUDIBLE]..

01:14:04.500 --> 01:14:05.160
AUDIENCE: Oh, yeah.

01:14:05.160 --> 01:14:05.550
AUDIENCE: Oh.

01:14:05.550 --> 01:14:06.180
[LAUGHTER]

01:14:06.180 --> 01:14:07.560
I'm trying to make a parabola.

01:14:07.560 --> 01:14:09.000
So it's a parabolic
solar cooker.

01:14:09.000 --> 01:14:10.650
AUDIENCE: That is not a
parabola, let me just say.

01:14:10.650 --> 01:14:12.420
AUDIENCE: That's why
I scratched it out

01:14:12.420 --> 01:14:17.250
so I could draw a parabola with
