01:14:17.250 --> 01:14:17.970
the idea from me.

01:14:17.970 --> 01:14:20.100
And I guess our sole source--

01:14:20.100 --> 01:14:22.650
they use solar cookers, and
they're in the Himalayas,

01:14:22.650 --> 01:14:24.630
