01:14:24.630 --> 01:14:25.440
they really mobile.

01:14:25.440 --> 01:14:27.232
You can fold them up
and carry them around.

01:14:27.232 --> 01:14:28.107
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

01:14:28.107 --> 01:14:29.510
AUDIENCE: So that was an idea.

01:14:29.510 --> 01:14:30.300
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE] anything.

01:14:30.300 --> 01:14:31.200
AUDIENCE: That's
a great drawing.

01:14:31.200 --> 01:14:32.672
AUDIENCE: No, [INAUDIBLE].

01:14:32.672 --> 01:14:33.500
[LAUGHS]

01:14:33.500 --> 01:14:34.290
AUDIENCE: He's like,
fine, whatever.

01:14:34.290 --> 01:14:35.640
AUDIENCE: It looks
like a funnel.

01:14:35.640 --> 01:14:37.770
AUDIENCE: You can redraw
